{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":5,"common":false,"forms":["叱り飛ばす","𠮟り飛ばす"],"glosses":["to rebuke strongly","to tell off"],"id":"1319560","lemma":"叱り飛ばす","pos":["v5s","vt"],"readingKata":"シカリトバス","readings":["しかりとばす"]},{"accent":5,"common":false,"examples":[{"en":"He was dressed down in public.","ja":"彼は人前でしかりつけられた。","ref":"300163_103530","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The owner of the small dog gripped its neck and scolded it.","ja":"小さな犬の飼い主は首を捕まえてしかりつけました。","ref":"267545_147016","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Don't tell me off like that.","ja":"そんな風に叱りつけないでくれ。","ref":"41275_204034","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Somebody should tell off that rude man.","ja":"あの無礼な男を誰かが叱り付けなければならない。","ref":"67810_230443","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"When the dog tried to bite me, I held him down by the neck and thoroughly scolded him.","ja":"その犬が噛みつこうとしたときに、首を押えつけてとことん叱りつけた。","ref":"394490_394489","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["叱り付ける","叱りつける","𠮟り付ける","𠮟りつける"],"glosses":["to rebuke","to scold harshly"],"id":"1319570","lemma":"叱り付ける","pos":["v1","vt"],"readingKata":"シカリツケル","readings":["しかりつける"]},{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"ja":"母に叱られる","source":"wty","zh":"被母亲骂"},{"en":"He was scolded by his mother.","ja":"彼は母親に叱られた。","ref":"303629_100068","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He has never been scolded by his father.","ja":"彼は父親に一度もしかられたことはない。","ref":"303332_100366","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He reproached me for carelessness.","ja":"彼は不注意だと私をしかった。","ref":"303231_100467","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He will scold us no matter what.","ja":"彼は必ず私達を叱るだろう。","ref":"303056_100642","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["叱る","𠮟る","呵る"],"glosses":["to scold","to chide","to rebuke","to reprimand"],"id":"1319580","lemma":"叱る","pos":["v5r","vt"],"readingKata":"シカル","readings":["しかる"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/叱る#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/叱/叱る/叱る.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["责备，训斥","叱るalternative kanji"],"zhSenses"